", "en": "ma'am — formal 'you' for a woman", "ex": "A senhora poderia me ajudar?", "tags": ["formality", "lesson 1"], "box": 0, "reviews": 0, "right": 0, "lapses": 0, "created": "2026-08-28", "audio": null}, {"id": "mtdbrkhf4x5tv", "chapterId": "mtdbrkhf2s2ai", "pt": "você", "en": "you (informal, and neutral for both genders)", "ex": "Você fala português, Paulo?", "tags": ["formality", "lesson 1"], "box": 0, "reviews": 0, "right": 0, "lapses": 0, "created": "2026-08-28", "audio": null}, {"id": "mtdbrkhf489mn", "chapterId": "mtdbrkhf2s2ai", "pt": "Com licença.", "en": "Excuse me.", "ex": "", "tags": ["introductions", "lesson 1"], "box": 0, "reviews": 0, "right": 0, "lapses": 0, "created": "2026-08-28", "audio": null}, {"id": "mtdbrkhfpja31", "chapterId": "mtdbrkhf2s2ai", "pt": "Desculpe.", "en": "I'm sorry.", "ex": "", "tags": ["introductions", "lesson 1"], "box": 0, "reviews": 0, "right": 0, "lapses": 0, "created": "2026-08-28", "audio": null}, {"id": "mtdbrkhf8k9ox", "chapterId": "mtdbrkhf2s2ai", "pt": "E aí?", "en": "What's happening?", "ex": "", "tags": ["introductions", "lesson 1"], "box": 0, "reviews": 0, "right": 0, "lapses": 0, "created": "2026-08-28", "audio": null}, {"id": "mtdbrkhf6sv62", "chapterId": "mtdbrkhf2s2ai", "pt": "Como você se chama?", "en": "What's your name? (infml.)", "ex": "", "tags": ["introductions", "lesson 1"], "box": 0, "reviews": 0, "right": 0, "lapses": 0, "created": "2026-08-28", "audio": null}, {"id": "mtdbrkhfbhp8s", "chapterId": "mtdbrkhf2s2ai", "pt": "Como o senhor se chama?", "en": "What's your name? (fml./m.)", "ex": "", "tags": ["introductions", "lesson 1"], "box": 0, "reviews": 0, "right": 0, "lapses": 0, "created": "2026-08-28", "audio": null}, {"id": "mtdbrkhfqacyo", "chapterId": "mtdbrkhf2s2ai", "pt": "Como a senhora se chama?", "en": "What's your name? (fml./f.)", "ex": "", "tags": ["introductions", "lesson 1"], "box": 0, "reviews": 0, "right": 0, "lapses": 0, "created": "2026-08-28", "audio": null}, {"id": "mtdbrkhfiuwe1